{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10354130","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10354130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1035413001:1":{"text":"There's a mechanism here.","source_cn":"就是这个遗迹的机关啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE409602DDE509209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035413002:1":{"text":"The three of us have been trying to figure it out for three weeks, but we've got nothing.","source_cn":"我们三个已经在这研究一个多星期了，但一无所获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2437E9659722ECAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1035413002":{"text":"The three of us have been trying to figure it out for three weeks, but we've got nothing.","source_cn":"我们三个已经在这研究一个多星期了，但一无所获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2437E9659722ECAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035413003:1":{"text":"Why else? We're writing a thesis! This is all for research!","source_cn":"还能为什么，当然是为了写论文！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C43429A6E5C3C8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1035413004:1":{"text":"Also, according to the books \"Annals of Esperia\", \"A Brief History of Ruins\", and \"The Encyclopedia of Faith Stone\", if we solve this mystery, we can claim the treasures inside.","source_cn":"而且，据《伊索米亚通史》、《遗迹简史》和《圣石百科》记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98CFA967F3364700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1035413005:1":{"text":"There is no way to verify the authenticity of this matter, but according to previous archaeological discoveries, treasures were indeed found after unlocking such mechanisms.","source_cn":"虽然关于此事的真假无从考证，但根据此前考古发现，确实有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F275D263AD8B8FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1035413006:1":{"text":"That's why we decided to come here to solve this mystery, but we had no idea it would be this difficult!","source_cn":"所以我们才下定决心试试，只是没想到这个机关那么难！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B49F8C14729F119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"Why so insistent?","source_cn":"你们为什么那么执着？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5CDCF4143CC6AEE7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why so insistent?","female":"Why so insistent?","variant_male_record_index":"62074","variant_female_record_index":"62075","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1035413007:1":{"text":"They plan to give up, but I still want to keep going!","source_cn":"他们俩打算放弃了，但我还要继续！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00CA174FD0A3A15A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1035413008:1":{"text":"I have to solve it! We've already been here for so long. What's a few more weeks?","source_cn":"我一定要把它给解开！既然已经花了一个星期了，那再多花点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B23E1887BA0B26B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Ready to give up?","source_cn":"那你们准备放弃了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1F4F264A4442A021","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Ready to give up?","female":"Ready to give up?","variant_male_record_index":"62076","variant_female_record_index":"62077","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者海伦娜":{"text":"Scholar Helenna","source":"冬青学者海伦娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":1}}